 =?UTF-8?q?=E8=A1=8C=E6=9C=AC)=20for=20book=20series?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

`/p1/subjects/:id/home` excludes offprint relations (type 1003), so the
subject page never showed a series' volumes. For book subjects with
`series: true`, fetch `/p1/subjects/:id/relations?offprint=true` and render
a 单行本 block with the total count between characters and relations,
matching the legacy site.

The request is non-suspense so it does not block the rest of the page,
and it is skipped entirely for non-series subjects.

